fixture tech11_ember_toss_cancel
doc BUILD.md s5 tech 11 "Ember-toss cancel (Ash): throw the ember mid-dash, teleport after landing. Taught by a chasm"; s6 Ember Toss "600 u/s projectile", "3 f startup", "teleport to it with 6 f of invulnerability"
room test/gorge
spawn 200 384
frames 140
input
  # A full jump, and the air dash toward the gorge at its top.
  0..21 jump
  22 R dash
  23..27 R
  # The throw on dash frame 7, toward the far side: the dash carries on.
  28 R toss
  29..30 R
  # The dash ends short of the edge (480 u); with the stick let go the player lands on the near
  # side.
  # Standing there once the ember has crossed the gorge and stopped in the air: teleport.
  90 toss
end
expect
  at 22 event.dash=1 state=dash
  at 28 event.toss=1 state=dash dash_frame=7
  during 28..30 state=dash
  # Out on the throw's frame 4 at the player's centre, flying 10 u a frame.
  at 31 ember=1 ember_x=10u+x@31
  # Its 40 frames of flight end over the far ledge, where it waits.
  at 69 ember_x=780u
  during 70..89 ember=1 ember_x=790u
  # The player lands on the near side, short of the edge.
  mark land 31..89 event.land=1
  at land x<470u state=ground
  at 90 event.teleport=1 ember=0 invuln=1 x=790u state=air
  during 90..95 invuln=1
  # The teleport leaves the player in the air above the far ledge; they land there.
  mark across 91..139 event.land=1
  at across y=384u x>746u
  never 0..139 event.hazard=1
end
